cz2pv.jpg"}, {"id": 1636484, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scz2pw.jpg"}], "slug": "casting-whispers", "storyline": "1961. Corburgh, Connecticut, USA. An old industrial city plagued by urban legends, the sins of its past, and unexplained phenomena. For Victoria, a lab assistant working in the field of psychic and mental psychology known as Extra-Sensory Perception (ESP), Corburgh was always home. A place to study and learn.\n\nBut tonight, something is very wrong with her trusted mentor, Professor Henry Zubringer. Something lies in wait at his apartment building. Something that has sat hidden in the heart of Corburgh for a very long time. Enter the shadows within 1195 Norman Ave., investigate what happened there, and try to save your friend... and yourself.", "summary": "Sound is your only hope for survival in this first-person psychological horror game. Investigate the mysteries of an apartment block in 1960s America terrorized by a cosmic horror, as you try to save your lost mentor\u2026 and yourself.", "themes": [{"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}, {"id": 20, "name": "Thriller"}, {"id": 22, "name": "Historical"}, {"id": 43, "name": "Mystery"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/casting-whispers", "videos": [{"id": 161748, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "9W0V3teUWIs", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9W0V3teUWIs", "title": "Casting Whispers Official Announce Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/9W0V3teUWIs/sddefault.jpg"}]}